{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36174","headline":"漳州阳亭言事寄于使君 · 方干","name":"漳州阳亭言事寄于使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢守登城对远峰，金英泛泛满金锺。\n楼头风景八九月，牀下水云千万重。\n红斾朝昏虽许近，清才今古定难逢。\n鲤鱼纵是凡鳞鬣，得在膺门合作龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}